@startuml
title 图4-3 订单管理模块小程序端下单交互时序图

actor 用户 as User
participant "微信小程序" as MiniApp
participant "AppOrderController" as AC
participant "IClOrderService" as OS
participant "ClOrderMapper" as OM
database "MySQL" as DB
collections "Redis" as Redis

User -> MiniApp : 选择商品并提交订单
MiniApp -> AC : POST /api/app/order/create\n携带 device_id
AC -> OS : createOrder(dto)
OS -> Redis : 读取商品缓存/校验库存
OS -> OM : insertOrder / insertItems
OM -> DB : 写入 cl_order、cl_order_item
OS -> DB : 更新库存
OS --> AC : 返回 order_no
AC --> MiniApp : {code:200, data}
MiniApp -> AC : POST /api/app/order/mockPay
AC -> OS : mockPay(orderId)
OS -> OM : updateStatus(已支付)
OM -> DB : 更新 cl_order.status
OS --> AC : 支付结果
AC --> MiniApp : 统一响应
MiniApp --> User : 展示下单成功

@enduml
